# What must never reach a container image, a build log, or Cloud Build.
#
# **This file is a security control, not an optimisation.** Cloud Build uploads
# the build context to Google before any Dockerfile runs, so anything not
# excluded here has already left this machine by the time a COPY would have
# skipped it. The first section is the part that matters; everything after it
# is ordinary hygiene.
#
# Both services build from the repository root (see cloudbuild.yaml), so this
# one file governs both contexts.

# --- Real, private church data. Never. -----------------------------------
# Mirrors the /local_data/ rule in .gitignore. Real rosters, real historical
# schedules, real names. It is git-ignored, which keeps it out of commits --
# and a build context is a completely separate path off this machine, so it
# needs excluding again, here.
local_data/
historical/
historical-data/
reports/
private-data/
real-data/
sample-data/**/*.private.*
**/*.private.*

# --- Secrets and credentials ----------------------------------------------
# Every deployed secret arrives from Secret Manager at run time. None is ever
# built into an image: a container image is not a private place -- anyone who
# can pull it can read every layer.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.demo.example
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
secrets.*
*_secret*
*credentials*
service-account*.json
client_secret*.json

# --- Git history ----------------------------------------------------------
# Excluded deliberately: .git holds every past version of every file, so
# shipping it would undo any later decision to stop tracking something.
.git/
.gitignore

# --- Build output and dependencies, rebuilt inside the image --------------
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
.next/
**/.next/
out/
build/
dist/
*.tsbuildinfo

# --- Python local state ---------------------------------------------------
.venv/
**/.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# --- Local scratch --------------------------------------------------------
cmds.txt
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
*.swp
*~
.idea/
.vscode/
*.log
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db
*.dump
